      47.85,
      413.65,
      539.95,
      448.72
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Section 32 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), read with Sections 12, 14and 22 as amended from time to time, I, Mahinda Rajapaksa, Minister of Finance, Economic and Policy Development, doby this Order declare the following, with effect from December 03, 2019.",
